# A knowledge model of the maternity allowance and the other parent's allowance in Switzerland
# (Mutterschaftsentschädigung, Entschädigung des andern Elternteils), from:
#   EOG   Federal Act on Compensation for Loss of Earnings (SR 834.1), Art. 16b to 16l
#
# Demonstration only: not legal or financial advice, not checked by a lawyer or a compensation
# office. The articles were checked against the consolidated text on fedlex.admin.ch on
# 16 October 2026 (in force since 1 June 2026).
#
# Reuse: this domain shares almost no knowledge with wef and vested-benefits. It imports no module
# but its law: no date of birth of the applicant, no marriage, no pension fund. It reuses the app,
# the engine and the form vocabulary (form.ttl): the steps, the yes/no answers, the severities, the
# texts of the app in four languages. It is the other end of the scale from vested-benefits.
#
# Scope and readings of the law:
#   - The mother and the other parent: since 2024 the law gives the leave to "the legal other
#     parent", the father or the mother's wife (EOG Art. 16i).
#   - Left out: the longer maternity allowance while the newborn is in hospital (Art. 16c para. 3),
#     a birth before the 9th month of pregnancy (which shortens the 9 months of insurance,
#     Art. 16b para. 2, 16i para. 2), the extra daily allowances when a parent dies, unemployed
#     parents and parents unable to work: the model tells them to ask their AHV compensation office.
#   - The average daily income: a monthly income divided by 30, an annual income from
#     self-employment divided by 360. Rounding is left out.
#   - The mother's last day is the 98th day of the allowance, the day of the birth being the first:
#     the date of birth plus 97 days (Art. 16c para. 2). It ends earlier if she starts working again.
#   - The other parent's framework period of 6 months begins on the day of the birth (Art. 16j). Our
#     reading of its last day: the day before the same date 6 months later, as for other framework
#     periods of the social insurances. The law and the leaflet of the compensation offices give no
#     example.

@prefix eo:   <https://example.org/parental-allowance#> .
@prefix form: <https://example.org/form#> .
@prefix law:  <https://example.org/ch-law#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix sh:   <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

eo: a owl:Ontology ;
  rdfs:label "Maternity and other parent's allowance" ;
  owl:imports form: , <https://example.org/ch-law/eog> ;
  sh:declare [ sh:prefix "eo" ; sh:namespace "https://example.org/parental-allowance#"^^xsd:anyURI ] .

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Choices
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

eo:mother rdfs:label "The mother"@en , "Die Mutter"@de , "La mère"@fr , "La madre"@it .
eo:otherParent
  rdfs:label "The other parent: the father, or the mother's wife"@en , "Der andere Elternteil: der Vater oder die Ehefrau der Mutter"@de ,
             "L'autre parent : le père ou l'épouse de la mère"@fr , "L'altro genitore: il padre o la moglie della madre"@it .

eo:employed rdfs:label "Employed"@en , "Angestellt"@de , "Salarié"@fr , "Dipendente"@it .
eo:selfEmployed rdfs:label "Self-employed"@en , "Selbständigerwerbend"@de , "Indépendant"@fr , "Indipendente"@it .
eo:spouseBusiness
  rdfs:label "Working in my spouse's business, for a cash wage"@en , "Mitarbeit im Betrieb meines Ehepartners, mit Barlohn"@de ,
             "Je travaille dans l'entreprise de mon conjoint, contre un salaire en espèces"@fr , "Lavoro nell'azienda del mio coniuge, con un salario in contanti"@it .
eo:otherStatus
  rdfs:label "Something else, for example unemployed"@en , "Etwas anderes, zum Beispiel arbeitslos"@de ,
             "Autre chose, par exemple au chômage"@fr , "Altro, ad esempio disoccupato"@it .

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Fields
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

eo:birth a sh:PropertyGroup ; sh:order 1 ;
  rdfs:label "Birth"@en , "Geburt"@de , "Naissance"@fr , "Nascita"@it .
eo:work a sh:PropertyGroup ; sh:order 2 ;
  rdfs:label "Work"@en , "Erwerbstätigkeit"@de , "Activité lucrative"@fr , "Attività lucrativa"@it .
eo:income a sh:PropertyGroup ; sh:order 3 ;
  rdfs:label "Income"@en , "Einkommen"@de , "Revenu"@fr , "Reddito"@it .

eo:Application a rdfs:Class ; rdfs:comment "An application for the maternity allowance or the other parent's allowance." .

eo:ApplicationShape a sh:NodeShape ;
  sh:targetClass eo:Application ;
  form:region "CH" ;
  rdfs:label "Maternity and other parent's allowance"@en , "Mutterschaftsentschädigung und Entschädigung des andern Elternteils"@de ,
             "Allocation de maternité et allocation de l'autre parent"@fr , "Indennità di maternità e indennità per l'altro genitore"@it ;
  rdfs:comment
    "Demonstration only. Not legal or financial advice. Simplified from EOG Art. 16b–16l, and not checked by a lawyer or a compensation office. Your AHV compensation office decides."@en ,
    "Nur zur Demonstration. Keine Rechts- oder Finanzberatung. Vereinfacht nach EOG Art. 16b–16l, nicht von einer Anwältin oder einer Ausgleichskasse geprüft. Massgebend ist der Entscheid Ihrer AHV-Ausgleichskasse."@de ,
    "Démonstration uniquement. Pas un conseil juridique ou financier. Simplifié d'après les art. 16b à 16l LAPG, non vérifié par un avocat ni par une caisse de compensation. La décision de votre caisse de compensation AVS fait foi."@fr ,
    "Solo a scopo dimostrativo. Non è una consulenza legale o finanziaria. Semplificato dagli art. 16b–16l LIPG, non verificato da un avvocato né da una cassa di compensazione. Fa stato la decisione della sua cassa di compensazione AVS."@it ;
  sh:property
    [ sh:path eo:parent ; sh:in ( eo:mother eo:otherParent ) ; sh:minCount 1 ;
      sh:group eo:birth ; sh:order 1 ;
      sh:name "Are you the mother or the other parent?"@en , "Sind Sie die Mutter oder der andere Elternteil?"@de ,
              "Êtes-vous la mère ou l'autre parent ?"@fr , "È la madre o l'altro genitore?"@it ;
      prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16b-1 , law:EOG-16i ] ,
    [ sh:path eo:childBirthDate ; sh:datatype xsd:date ; sh:minCount 1 ;
      sh:group eo:birth ; sh:order 2 ;
      sh:name "Date of birth of the child"@en , "Geburtsdatum des Kindes"@de ,
              "Date de naissance de l'enfant"@fr , "Data di nascita del bambino"@it ;
      prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16c-1 , law:EOG-16j ] ,
    [ sh:path eo:legalParent ; sh:in ( form:yes form:no ) ; sh:minCount 1 ;
      sh:group eo:birth ; sh:order 3 ;
      form:askedWhen [ sh:prefixes eo: ; sh:ask "ASK { $this eo:parent eo:otherParent }" ] ;
      sh:name "Are you the child's legal other parent, or will you be within 6 months of the birth?"@en ,
              "Sind Sie rechtlich der andere Elternteil des Kindes, oder werden Sie es innerhalb von 6 Monaten nach der Geburt?"@de ,
              "Êtes-vous juridiquement l'autre parent de l'enfant, ou le deviendrez-vous dans les 6 mois suivant la naissance ?"@fr ,
              "È giuridicamente l'altro genitore del bambino, o lo diventerà entro 6 mesi dalla nascita?"@it ;
      prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16i ] ,
    [ sh:path eo:leaveStart ; sh:datatype xsd:date ; sh:minCount 1 ;
      sh:group eo:birth ; sh:order 4 ;
      form:askedWhen [ sh:prefixes eo: ; sh:ask "ASK { $this eo:parent eo:otherParent }" ] ;
      sh:name "First day of your leave"@en , "Erster Tag Ihres Urlaubs"@de ,
              "Premier jour de votre congé"@fr , "Primo giorno del suo congedo"@it ;
      sh:description "You take the 2 weeks within the 6 months after the birth, as weeks or as single days."@en ,
                     "Sie beziehen die 2 Wochen innerhalb der 6 Monate nach der Geburt, wochenweise oder tageweise."@de ,
                     "Vous prenez les 2 semaines dans les 6 mois suivant la naissance, par semaines ou par jours."@fr ,
                     "Prende le 2 settimane entro i 6 mesi dopo la nascita, a settimane o a giorni."@it ;
      prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16j ] ,

    [ sh:path eo:insured ; sh:in ( form:yes form:no ) ; sh:minCount 1 ;
      sh:group eo:work ; sh:order 1 ;
      sh:name "In the 9 months before the birth, were you insured under the AHV?"@en ,
              "Waren Sie in den 9 Monaten vor der Geburt in der AHV versichert?"@de ,
              "Durant les 9 mois précédant la naissance, étiez-vous assuré à l'AVS ?"@fr ,
              "Nei 9 mesi prima della nascita era assicurato all'AVS?"@it ;
      sh:description "Insured under the mandatory scheme, for example because you lived or worked in Switzerland."@en ,
                     "Obligatorisch versichert, zum Beispiel weil Sie in der Schweiz wohnten oder arbeiteten."@de ,
                     "Assuré obligatoirement, par exemple parce que vous habitiez ou travailliez en Suisse."@fr ,
                     "Assicurato obbligatoriamente, ad esempio perché abitava o lavorava in Svizzera."@it ;
      prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16b-1 , law:EOG-16i ] ,
    [ sh:path eo:worked ; sh:in ( form:yes form:no ) ; sh:minCount 1 ;
      sh:group eo:work ; sh:order 2 ;
      sh:name "Did you work for at least 5 of those 9 months?"@en , "Haben Sie in diesen 9 Monaten mindestens 5 Monate gearbeitet?"@de ,
              "Avez-vous travaillé au moins 5 mois durant ces 9 mois ?"@fr , "Ha lavorato almeno 5 mesi in questi 9 mesi?"@it ;
      prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16b-1 , law:EOG-16i ] ,
    [ sh:path eo:status ; sh:in ( eo:employed eo:selfEmployed eo:spouseBusiness eo:otherStatus ) ; sh:minCount 1 ;
      sh:group eo:work ; sh:order 3 ;
      sh:name "What was your situation on the day of the birth?"@en , "Wie war Ihre Situation am Tag der Geburt?"@de ,
              "Quelle était votre situation le jour de la naissance ?"@fr , "Qual era la sua situazione il giorno della nascita?"@it ;
      prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16b-1 , law:EOG-16i ] ,

    [ sh:path eo:monthlyIncome ; sh:datatype xsd:decimal ; sh:minInclusive 0 ; sh:minCount 1 ;
      sh:group eo:income ; sh:order 1 ;
      form:askedWhen [ sh:prefixes eo: ; sh:ask "ASK { $this eo:status ?s FILTER (?s IN (eo:employed, eo:spouseBusiness)) }" ] ;
      sh:name "Your average monthly income before the birth (CHF)"@en , "Ihr durchschnittliches Monatseinkommen vor der Geburt (CHF)"@de ,
              "Votre revenu mensuel moyen avant la naissance (CHF)"@fr , "Il suo reddito mensile medio prima della nascita (CHF)"@it ;
      sh:description "Gross, as on your payslips; your employer confirms it."@en , "Brutto, wie auf Ihren Lohnabrechnungen; Ihr Arbeitgeber bestätigt es."@de ,
                     "Brut, comme sur vos fiches de salaire ; votre employeur le confirme."@fr , "Lordo, come sulle sue buste paga; il suo datore di lavoro lo conferma."@it ;
      prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16e , law:EOG-16l ] ,
    [ sh:path eo:annualIncome ; sh:datatype xsd:decimal ; sh:minInclusive 0 ; sh:minCount 1 ;
      sh:group eo:income ; sh:order 2 ;
      form:askedWhen [ sh:prefixes eo: ; sh:ask "ASK { $this eo:status eo:selfEmployed }" ] ;
      sh:name "Your annual income from self-employment (CHF)"@en , "Ihr Jahreseinkommen aus selbständiger Erwerbstätigkeit (CHF)"@de ,
              "Votre revenu annuel d'activité indépendante (CHF)"@fr , "Il suo reddito annuo da attività indipendente (CHF)"@it ;
      sh:description "The income on which you pay AHV contributions."@en , "Das Einkommen, auf dem Sie AHV-Beiträge bezahlen."@de ,
                     "Le revenu sur lequel vous payez des cotisations AVS."@fr , "Il reddito sul quale paga i contributi AVS."@it ;
      prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16e , law:EOG-16l ] .

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Rules
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# $this is the application. Dates are compared and added to durations as in XPath.

eo:ApplicationShape sh:rule
  [ a sh:SPARQLRule ; sh:order 1 ; sh:prefixes eo: , form: ;
    rdfs:comment "The average daily income of a person with a wage: the monthly income divided by 30." ;
    sh:construct """
      CONSTRUCT { $this eo:dailyIncome ?daily }
      WHERE {
        $this eo:status ?status ; eo:monthlyIncome ?monthly
        FILTER (?status IN (eo:employed, eo:spouseBusiness))
        BIND (?monthly / 30 AS ?daily)
      }""" ] ,

  [ a sh:SPARQLRule ; sh:order 1 ; sh:prefixes eo: , form: ;
    rdfs:comment "The average daily income of a self-employed person: the annual income divided by 360." ;
    sh:construct """
      CONSTRUCT { $this eo:dailyIncome ?daily }
      WHERE { $this eo:status eo:selfEmployed ; eo:annualIncome ?annual BIND (?annual / 360 AS ?daily) }""" ] ,

  [ a sh:SPARQLRule ; sh:order 2 ; sh:prefixes eo: , form: ;
    rdfs:comment "80 % of the average daily income, at most CHF 220." ;
    sh:construct """
      CONSTRUCT { $this eo:dailyAllowance ?allowance }
      WHERE {
        $this eo:dailyIncome ?daily .
        BIND (?daily * 0.8 AS ?share)
        BIND (IF(?share > 220, 220, ?share) AS ?allowance)
      }""" ] ,

  [ a sh:SPARQLRule ; sh:order 1 ; sh:prefixes eo: , form: ;
    sh:construct """
      CONSTRUCT { $this eo:days 98 ; eo:lastAllowanceDay ?last }
      WHERE { $this eo:parent eo:mother ; eo:childBirthDate ?birth BIND (?birth + "P97D"^^xsd:dayTimeDuration AS ?last) }""" ] ,

  [ a sh:SPARQLRule ; sh:order 1 ; sh:prefixes eo: , form: ;
    sh:construct """
      CONSTRUCT { $this eo:days 14 ; eo:lastLeaveDay ?last }
      WHERE {
        $this eo:parent eo:otherParent ; eo:childBirthDate ?birth
        BIND ((?birth + "P6M"^^xsd:yearMonthDuration) - "P1D"^^xsd:dayTimeDuration AS ?last)
      }""" ] ,

  [ a sh:SPARQLRule ; sh:order 3 ; sh:prefixes eo: , form: ;
    sh:construct """
      CONSTRUCT { $this eo:totalAllowance ?total }
      WHERE { $this eo:days ?days ; eo:dailyAllowance ?allowance BIND (?days * ?allowance AS ?total) }""" ] ,

  [ a sh:SPARQLRule ; sh:order 1 ; sh:prefixes eo: , form: ;
    sh:construct """
      CONSTRUCT { $this form:finding eo:NotBornYet }
      WHERE { $this eo:childBirthDate ?birth ; form:today ?today FILTER (?birth > ?today) }""" ] ,

  [ a sh:SPARQLRule ; sh:order 1 ; sh:prefixes eo: , form: ;
    sh:construct """
      CONSTRUCT { $this form:finding eo:NotInsured }
      WHERE { $this eo:insured form:no }""" ] ,

  [ a sh:SPARQLRule ; sh:order 1 ; sh:prefixes eo: , form: ;
    sh:construct """
      CONSTRUCT { $this form:finding eo:NotEnoughWork }
      WHERE { $this eo:worked form:no }""" ] ,

  [ a sh:SPARQLRule ; sh:order 1 ; sh:prefixes eo: , form: ;
    sh:construct """
      CONSTRUCT { $this form:finding eo:AskOffice }
      WHERE { $this eo:status eo:otherStatus }""" ] ,

  [ a sh:SPARQLRule ; sh:order 1 ; sh:prefixes eo: , form: ;
    sh:construct """
      CONSTRUCT { $this form:finding eo:NotLegalParent }
      WHERE { $this eo:parent eo:otherParent ; eo:legalParent form:no }""" ] ,

  [ a sh:SPARQLRule ; sh:order 2 ; sh:prefixes eo: , form: ;
    rdfs:comment "The leave starts within the 6 months after the birth." ;
    sh:construct """
      CONSTRUCT { $this form:finding eo:LeaveOutsidePeriod }
      WHERE {
        $this eo:childBirthDate ?birth ; eo:leaveStart ?start ; eo:lastLeaveDay ?last .
        FILTER (?start < ?birth || ?start > ?last)
      }""" ] ,

  [ a sh:SPARQLRule ; sh:order 1 ; sh:prefixes eo: , form: ;
    sh:construct """
      CONSTRUCT { $this form:nextStep eo:Claim }
      WHERE { }""" ] ,

  [ a sh:SPARQLRule ; sh:order 1 ; sh:prefixes eo: , form: ;
    sh:construct """
      CONSTRUCT { $this form:nextStep eo:EndsEarly }
      WHERE { $this eo:parent eo:mother }""" ] ,

  [ a sh:SPARQLRule ; sh:order 1 ; sh:prefixes eo: , form: ;
    sh:construct """
      CONSTRUCT { $this form:nextStep eo:TakeWithinSixMonths }
      WHERE { $this eo:parent eo:otherParent }""" ] .

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Values, findings and next steps
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

eo:dailyIncome a rdf:Property ;
  rdfs:comment "The average daily income before the birth." ;
  prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16e , law:EOG-16l .

eo:dailyAllowance a form:Value ; sh:order 1 ;
  rdfs:label "Daily allowance (CHF)"@en , "Taggeld (CHF)"@de , "Allocation journalière (CHF)"@fr , "Indennità giornaliera (CHF)"@it ;
  prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16e , law:EOG-16f , law:EOG-16l .
eo:days a form:Value ; sh:order 2 ;
  rdfs:label "Number of daily allowances"@en , "Anzahl Taggelder"@de ,
             "Nombre d'allocations journalières"@fr , "Numero di indennità giornaliere"@it ;
  prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16d , law:EOG-16k .
eo:totalAllowance a form:Value ; sh:order 3 ;
  rdfs:label "Total, at most (CHF)"@en , "Gesamtbetrag, höchstens (CHF)"@de , "Montant total, au plus (CHF)"@fr , "Importo totale, al massimo (CHF)"@it ;
  prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16d , law:EOG-16k .
eo:lastAllowanceDay a form:Value ; sh:order 4 ;
  rdfs:label "Last day of the allowance, at the latest"@en , "Letzter Tag der Entschädigung, spätestens"@de ,
             "Dernier jour de l'allocation, au plus tard"@fr , "Ultimo giorno dell'indennità, al più tardi"@it ;
  prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16c-2 , law:EOG-16d .
eo:lastLeaveDay a form:Value ; sh:order 5 ;
  rdfs:label "Last day to take the leave"@en , "Letzter Tag für den Urlaub"@de ,
             "Dernier jour pour prendre le congé"@fr , "Ultimo giorno per prendere il congedo"@it ;
  prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16j .

eo:NotBornYet a form:Finding ; form:severity form:NotYet ;
  rdfs:label "The child is not born yet"@en , "Das Kind ist noch nicht geboren"@de , "L'enfant n'est pas encore né"@fr , "Il bambino non è ancora nato"@it ;
  rdfs:comment "The entitlement begins with the birth. Apply after it."@en , "Der Anspruch beginnt mit der Geburt. Stellen Sie den Antrag danach."@de ,
               "Le droit naît avec la naissance. Faites la demande après celle-ci."@fr , "Il diritto nasce con la nascita. Presenti la domanda dopo di essa."@it ;
  prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16c-1 , law:EOG-16i .
eo:NotInsured a form:Finding ; form:severity form:Refusal ;
  rdfs:label "Not insured under the AHV for 9 months"@en , "Nicht 9 Monate in der AHV versichert"@de ,
             "Pas assuré 9 mois à l'AVS"@fr , "Non assicurato 9 mesi all'AVS"@it ;
  rdfs:comment "The allowance needs 9 months of AHV insurance immediately before the birth."@en ,
               "Die Entschädigung setzt 9 Monate AHV-Versicherung unmittelbar vor der Geburt voraus."@de ,
               "L'allocation suppose 9 mois d'assurance AVS immédiatement avant la naissance."@fr ,
               "L'indennità presuppone 9 mesi di assicurazione AVS immediatamente prima della nascita."@it ;
  prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16b-1 , law:EOG-16i .
eo:NotEnoughWork a form:Finding ; form:severity form:Refusal ;
  rdfs:label "Less than 5 months of work"@en , "Weniger als 5 Monate Erwerbstätigkeit"@de ,
             "Moins de 5 mois d'activité lucrative"@fr , "Meno di 5 mesi di attività lucrativa"@it ;
  rdfs:comment "The allowance needs at least 5 months of work in the 9 months before the birth."@en ,
               "Die Entschädigung setzt mindestens 5 Monate Erwerbstätigkeit in den 9 Monaten vor der Geburt voraus."@de ,
               "L'allocation suppose au moins 5 mois d'activité lucrative durant les 9 mois précédant la naissance."@fr ,
               "L'indennità presuppone almeno 5 mesi di attività lucrativa nei 9 mesi prima della nascita."@it ;
  prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16b-1 , law:EOG-16i .
eo:NotLegalParent a form:Finding ; form:severity form:Refusal ;
  rdfs:label "Not the legal other parent"@en , "Rechtlich nicht der andere Elternteil"@de ,
             "Pas juridiquement l'autre parent"@fr , "Non giuridicamente l'altro genitore"@it ;
  rdfs:comment "The other parent's allowance is for the child's legal other parent, at the birth or within the 6 months after it."@en ,
               "Die Entschädigung des andern Elternteils ist für den rechtlichen andern Elternteil des Kindes, bei der Geburt oder in den 6 Monaten danach."@de ,
               "L'allocation de l'autre parent est pour l'autre parent juridique de l'enfant, à la naissance ou dans les 6 mois qui suivent."@fr ,
               "L'indennità per l'altro genitore è per l'altro genitore giuridico del bambino, alla nascita o nei 6 mesi successivi."@it ;
  prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16i .
eo:LeaveOutsidePeriod a form:Finding ; form:severity form:Refusal ;
  rdfs:label "The leave is outside the 6 months after the birth"@en , "Der Urlaub liegt ausserhalb der 6 Monate nach der Geburt"@de ,
             "Le congé est en dehors des 6 mois suivant la naissance"@fr , "Il congedo è fuori dai 6 mesi dopo la nascita"@it ;
  rdfs:comment "Take the leave within the 6 months after the birth; after them, the entitlement ends."@en ,
               "Beziehen Sie den Urlaub innerhalb der 6 Monate nach der Geburt; danach endet der Anspruch."@de ,
               "Prenez le congé dans les 6 mois suivant la naissance ; ensuite, le droit prend fin."@fr ,
               "Prenda il congedo entro i 6 mesi dopo la nascita; in seguito il diritto si estingue."@it ;
  prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16j .
eo:AskOffice a form:Finding ; form:severity form:Notice ;
  rdfs:label "Ask your AHV compensation office"@en , "Fragen Sie Ihre AHV-Ausgleichskasse"@de ,
             "Demandez à votre caisse de compensation AVS"@fr , "Chieda alla sua cassa di compensazione AVS"@it ;
  rdfs:comment "Other situations, for example unemployment or inability to work at the birth, have their own conditions, which this demonstration leaves out."@en ,
               "Andere Situationen, zum Beispiel Arbeitslosigkeit oder Arbeitsunfähigkeit bei der Geburt, haben eigene Voraussetzungen, die diese Demo nicht abbildet."@de ,
               "D'autres situations, par exemple le chômage ou une incapacité de travail à la naissance, ont leurs propres conditions, que cette démo ne couvre pas."@fr ,
               "Altre situazioni, ad esempio la disoccupazione o l'incapacità al lavoro alla nascita, hanno condizioni proprie, che questa demo non copre."@it ;
  prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16b-1 , law:EOG-16i .

eo:Claim a form:NextStep ; sh:order 1 ;
  rdfs:label "Your employer, or you if you are self-employed, claims the allowance with the form of your AHV compensation office."@en ,
             "Ihr Arbeitgeber, oder Sie selbst als Selbständigerwerbende, machen den Anspruch mit dem Formular Ihrer AHV-Ausgleichskasse geltend."@de ,
             "Votre employeur, ou vous-même si vous êtes indépendant, fait valoir le droit avec le formulaire de votre caisse de compensation AVS."@fr ,
             "Il suo datore di lavoro, o lei stesso se è indipendente, fa valere il diritto con il modulo della sua cassa di compensazione AVS."@it ;
  prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG .
eo:EndsEarly a form:NextStep ; sh:order 2 ;
  rdfs:label "The allowance ends early if you start working again."@en , "Die Entschädigung endet vorzeitig, wenn Sie die Erwerbstätigkeit wieder aufnehmen."@de ,
             "L'allocation prend fin plus tôt si vous reprenez une activité lucrative."@fr , "L'indennità termina prima se riprende un'attività lucrativa."@it ;
  prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16d .
eo:TakeWithinSixMonths a form:NextStep ; sh:order 3 ;
  rdfs:label "Take the 14 daily allowances within the 6 months after the birth: 7 for each week of leave, or 2 more for each 5 days taken as single days."@en ,
             "Beziehen Sie die 14 Taggelder innerhalb der 6 Monate nach der Geburt: 7 pro Woche Urlaub, oder 2 zusätzliche pro 5 einzeln bezogene Tage."@de ,
             "Prenez les 14 allocations journalières dans les 6 mois suivant la naissance : 7 par semaine de congé, ou 2 de plus pour 5 jours pris séparément."@fr ,
             "Prenda le 14 indennità giornaliere entro i 6 mesi dopo la nascita: 7 per settimana di congedo, oppure 2 in più per 5 giorni presi singolarmente."@it ;
  prov:wasDerivedFrom law:EOG-16j , law:EOG-16k .
